The files schema/source-rules.json, schema/statement-schema.json and the
files generated from them describe the public interface of the European
Commission's DSA Transparency Database (attribute names, allowed values and
their labels, limits). These facts were taken from
https://github.com/digital-services-act/transparency-database, which is
published under the GNU General Public License v2.0. No code from that
repository is included: only the interoperable attribute names, enumeration
values and their labels, and limits needed to talk to the API. Rationale is
not affiliated with or endorsed by the European Commission.
